        "title": "EMI Calculator: The Reducing Balance vs Flat Rate Math and Amortization Secrets",
        "desc": "Master your Equated Monthly Installment (EMI) calculations. Understand reducing balance vs flat rate formulas, loan amortization schedules, and prepayment impacts.",
        "calc": "emi",
        "date": "May 2026",
        "isoDate": "2026-05-15",
