        "title": "TDS Rates and Sections: Complete Tabular Reference, 15G/15H Rules, and Form 26AS",
        "desc": "Master your Tax Deducted at Source (TDS) planning. Access the complete tabular section reference, understand Form 15G/15H rules, and reconcile Form 26AS/AIS credits.",
        "calc": "tds",
        "date": "May 2026",
