        "title": "Freelancer Tax Guide: Presumptive Taxation (Section 44ADA), Deductions, and ITR Filing",
        "desc": "Complete tax guide for Indian freelancers, consultants, and independent professionals. Learn about Section 44ADA presumptive taxation, ITR-4, and TDS rules.",
        "calc": "freelancetax",
