        "title": "Goal-Based SIP: How to Reverse-Calculate Your Path to Financial Freedom",
        "desc": "Stop investing aimlessly. Learn how to reverse-calculate your monthly SIP to hit specific financial targets like child education, home buying, or retirement.",
        "calc": "goalsip",
        "date": "May 2026",
