        "title": "Asset Allocation: The Scientific Strategy to Balance Risk and Wealth",
        "desc": "Master the science of portfolio diversification. Learn the 100-minus-age rule, modern portfolio theory, and how to allocate between equity, debt, and gold in India.",
        "calc": "assetalloc",
        "date": "May 2026",
