        "desc": "Master National Pension System (NPS) Tier-I & Tier-II details. Understand the Section 80CCD(1B) ₹50,000 tax deduction, Active vs Auto choice, and withdrawal rules.",
        "calc": "nps",
        "date": "May 2026",
