        "title": "Retirement Calculator: How to Calculate Your Target Corpus with Inflation",
        "desc": "Plan your retirement using our step-by-step calculator. Understand inflation impact, post-retirement lifestyle costs, safe withdrawal rates, and annuity options.",
        "calc": "retirement",
        "date": "May 2026",
