        "title": "Protein Calculator: How Much Protein Do You Need Daily?",
        "desc": "Protein needs by activity level, body weight, and fitness goals. Vegetarian vs non-veg sources ranked by protein-per-rupee.",
        "calc": "protein",
        "date": "May 2026",
