        "title": "BMI Calculator for Indians: Why Asian Cutoffs Matter for Metabolic Health",
        "desc": "Standard vs Asian BMI cutoffs, why Indians face higher cardiovascular and diabetes risk at a lower BMI, and how to track visceral fat.",
        "calc": "bmi",
        "date": "May 2026",
        "isoDate": "2026-05-15",
