        "title": "Body Recomposition Guide: How to Build Muscle and Lose Fat Simultaneously",
        "desc": "The science of simultaneous muscle gain and fat loss. Learn about slight caloric deficits, protein thresholds, progressive resistance, and realistic timelines.",
        "calc": "bodyrecomp",
        "date": "May 2026",
