        "title": "HRA vs Home Loan: Which Tax Benefit Is Better?",
        "desc": "Can you claim both HRA and home loan deduction? Rules for renting and owning simultaneously, and which saves more tax.",
        "calc": "hravshomeloan",
        "date": "May 2026",
        "isoDate": "2026-05-15",
