        "title": "Car Lease vs Buy Calculator: Which Option Saves More?",
        "desc": "Total cost comparison of leasing vs buying over 5 years. Depreciation, tax implications, and when leasing makes financial sense.",
        "calc": "carleasevsbuy",
        "date": "May 2026",
